OL,3,APrincess Diana's 'revenge dress' goes
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dress worn by Princess Diana dubbed
OL,7,Fher "revenge dress" is being put up for
OL,8,Fauction.
OL,10,FThe late Princess of Wales wore the
OL,11,Fstrapless black silk evening dress to a
OL,12,Fparty in London hours after her
OL,13,Fthen-estranged husband Prince Charles
OL,14,Fadmitted to committing adultery during
OL,15,Ftheir marriage.
OL,17,FHer dramatic arrival at the Serpentine
OL,18,FGallery in 1994 in the outfit became an
OL,19,Ficonic pop-culture moment.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
