OL,3,APrincess Diana's 'revenge dress' goes
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuction house Sotheby's expects the
OL,7,Fdress to sell for up to #220,000
OL,8,F($300,000) when it goes under the
OL,9,Fhammer on 9 December - the first time
OL,10,Fit has been up for auction since 1997,
OL,11,Fwhen the princess sold 79 of her
OL,12,Fdresses just months before her death to
OL,13,Fraise money for charities.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
